# BAB 4. Financial Foundation and Chart of Accounts Schema

## 4.1 Overview

Bab ini mendesain fondasi domain **Financial Core**: Financial Organization, Fiscal Calendar, Currency Management, dan Chart of Accounts (CoA). Fondasi ini menjadi kerangka pencatatan bagi General Ledger dan seluruh sub-ledger (BAB 5). Desain mengacu BRD 9.5 (Financial Foundation) & 9.6 (Chart of Accounts) dan mengikuti standar BAB 2.

---

## 4.2 Financial Organization (`coa_db`)

Merealisasikan BRD 9.5.1: entitas keuangan (legal entity, ledger, company code) yang selaras Organization Tree namun independen dari struktur operasional.

### `fin.financial_organization`

| Column           | Type         | Null | Key | Description                                                    |
| ---------------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `code`           | VARCHAR(50)  | No   | U   | Kode entitas keuangan (company code).                          |
| `name`           | VARCHAR(200) | No   |     | Nama legal entity.                                             |
| `organization_ref_id`| UUID     | No   | IDX | Referensi logis ke `org.organization`.                        |
| `functional_currency_code`| VARCHAR(3)| No |     | Mata uang fungsional (BRD 9.5.3).                          |
| `chart_of_accounts_id`| UUID    | No   | FK  | CoA yang digunakan.                                            |
| `fiscal_calendar_id`| UUID      | No   | FK  | Kalender fiskal yang berlaku.                                  |

### `fin.ledger`

| Column           | Type         | Null | Key | Description                                                    |
| ---------------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `financial_organization_id`| UUID| No | FK  | Entitas keuangan pemilik.                                      |
| `code`           | VARCHAR(50)  | No   | U   | Kode ledger.                                                   |
| `ledger_type`    | VARCHAR(30)  | No   |     | Primary/Statutory/Management/Consolidation.                    |
| `currency_code`  | VARCHAR(3)   | No   |     | Mata uang ledger.                                              |

