## 4.3 Fiscal Calendar

Merealisasikan BRD 9.5.2: periode akuntansi, tahun buku, penutupan periode per entitas.

```mermaid
erDiagram
  FISCAL_CALENDAR ||--o{ FISCAL_YEAR : contains
  FISCAL_YEAR ||--o{ FISCAL_PERIOD : contains
```

### `fin.fiscal_calendar`

| Column        | Type         | Null | Key | Description                          |
| ------------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | ------------------------------------ |
| `code`        | VARCHAR(50)  | No   | U   | Kode kalender fiskal.                |
| `name`        | VARCHAR(150) | No   |     | Nama.                                |
| `period_type` | VARCHAR(20)  | No   |     | Monthly/Quarterly (jumlah periode).  |

### `fin.fiscal_period`

| Column          | Type        | Null | Key | Description                                          |
| --------------- | ----------- | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `fiscal_year_id`| UUID        | No   | FK  | Tahun buku.                                          |
| `period_no`     | INTEGER     | No   |     | Nomor periode (1–12/13).                             |
| `start_date`    | DATE        | No   |     | Awal periode.                                        |
| `end_date`      | DATE        | No   |     | Akhir periode.                                       |
| `status`        | VARCHAR(20) | No   |     | Open/Closed/Locked (BR-562).                         |

> `status` = Closed/Locked mencegah posting jurnal baru (validasi di `gl-service`, BR-562).

