## 4.4 Currency Management (`currency_db`)

Merealisasikan BRD 9.5.3 (17 sub-domain): mata uang, pasangan, tipe & sumber kurs, kurs bertanggal.

```mermaid
erDiagram
  CURRENCY ||--o{ CURRENCY_PAIR : base_or_quote
  CURRENCY_PAIR ||--o{ EXCHANGE_RATE : has
  EXCHANGE_RATE_TYPE ||--o{ EXCHANGE_RATE : classifies
```

### `cur.currency`

| Column        | Type        | Null | Key | Description                                          |
| ------------- | ----------- | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `code`        | VARCHAR(3)  | No   | U   | ISO 4217 alfabetik (BRD Currency Master).            |
| `numeric_code`| VARCHAR(3)  | Yes  |     | ISO 4217 numerik.                                    |
| `name`        | VARCHAR(100)| No   |     | Nama mata uang.                                      |
| `precision`   | INTEGER     | No   |     | Presisi desimal (Currency Precision).                |
| `is_active`   | BOOLEAN     | No   |     | Status aktif.                                        |

### `cur.exchange_rate_type`

| Column  | Type        | Null | Key | Description                              |
| ------- | ----------- | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------- |
| `code`  | VARCHAR(30) | No   | U   | Spot/Historical/Budget/Average/Closing.  |
| `name`  | VARCHAR(100)| No   |     | Nama tipe kurs.                          |

### `cur.exchange_rate`

| Column          | Type          | Null | Key | Description                                          |
| --------------- | ------------- | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `from_currency` | VARCHAR(3)    | No   | IDX | Mata uang asal.                                      |
| `to_currency`   | VARCHAR(3)    | No   | IDX | Mata uang tujuan.                                    |
| `rate_type_id`  | UUID          | No   | FK  | Tipe kurs.                                           |
| `rate`          | NUMERIC(20,8) | No   |     | Nilai kurs.                                          |
| `valid_from`    | DATE          | No   | IDX | Berlaku sejak (bertanggal — Currency Management).    |
| `valid_to`      | DATE          | Yes  |     | Berlaku hingga.                                      |

**Unique:** `uq_exchange_rate (organization_id, from_currency, to_currency, rate_type_id, valid_from)`.

