## 4.5 Chart of Accounts (`coa_db`)

Merealisasikan BRD 9.6 (25 sub-domain): struktur akun bersegmen, kombinasi akun, posting rule, pemetaan. Menjadi kerangka pencatatan GL.

```mermaid
erDiagram
  COA ||--o{ ACCOUNT_SEGMENT : defines
  ACCOUNT_SEGMENT ||--o{ SEGMENT_VALUE : allows
  COA ||--o{ ACCOUNT : contains
  ACCOUNT ||--o{ ACCOUNT_COMBINATION : composed_in
  COA ||--o{ POSTING_RULE : governs
```

### `coa.chart_of_accounts`

| Column     | Type         | Null | Key | Description                          |
| ---------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | ------------------------------------ |
| `code`     | VARCHAR(50)  | No   | U   | Kode CoA (CoA Master).               |
| `name`     | VARCHAR(150) | No   |     | Nama.                                |
| `structure`| JSONB        | No   |     | Definisi struktur segmen (urutan/panjang). |

### `coa.account`

| Column          | Type         | Null | Key | Description                                          |
| --------------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `chart_of_accounts_id`| UUID   | No   | FK  | CoA induk.                                           |
| `code`          | VARCHAR(50)  | No   | U   | Kode akun (unik per CoA).                            |
| `name`          | VARCHAR(200) | No   |     | Nama akun.                                           |
| `account_type`  | VARCHAR(30)  | No   |     | Asset/Liability/Equity/Revenue/Expense (Account Type).|
| `account_class` | VARCHAR(30)  | Yes  |     | Klasifikasi lanjutan (Account Class).                |
| `is_control`    | BOOLEAN      | No   |     | Akun kontrol (sub-ledger) — Account Control.         |
| `is_monetary`   | BOOLEAN      | No   |     | Akun mata uang asing (untuk revaluasi, BR-561).      |
| `allow_posting` | BOOLEAN      | No   |     | Boleh diposting (leaf) vs header (Account Activation).|
| `parent_id`     | UUID         | Yes  | FK  | Hierarki akun (Account Hierarchy).                   |

### `coa.account_segment` & `coa.segment_value`

| Table                 | Kolom kunci                                                    | Deskripsi                              |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `coa.account_segment` | `chart_of_accounts_id`, `segment_no`, `name`, `length`        | Definisi segmen (Segment).             |
| `coa.segment_value`   | `segment_id`, `value`, `description`, `is_active`             | Nilai valid per segmen (Segment Value).|

### `coa.account_combination` (kombinasi segmen valid — Account Combination)

| Column          | Type         | Null | Key | Description                                          |
| --------------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `chart_of_accounts_id`| UUID   | No   | FK  | CoA.                                                 |
| `combination_code`| VARCHAR(100)| No | U   | Kode kombinasi (concatenated segments).              |
| `is_enabled`    | BOOLEAN      | No   |     | Diizinkan/diblokir (Account Validation Rule).        |

### `coa.posting_rule` (Posting Rule / Account Derivation)

| Column          | Type         | Null | Key | Description                                          |
| --------------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `source_module` | VARCHAR(50)  | No   | IDX | Modul sumber (AP/AR/Inventory/Payroll/…).            |
| `event_key`     | VARCHAR(100) | No   |     | Peristiwa akuntansi (mis. goods_issue, invoice).     |
| `debit_account_rule`| JSONB    | No   |     | Aturan penentu akun debit (derivation).              |
| `credit_account_rule`| JSONB   | No   |     | Aturan penentu akun kredit.                          |

> Posting Rule menjadi acuan `automatic journal posting` (BR-558) yang memetakan transaksi sub-ledger ke akun GL.

---

## 4.6 Summary

Bab ini mendesain fondasi finansial: **Financial Organization/Ledger** (entitas keuangan selaras Organization Tree), **Fiscal Calendar** (periode dengan status Open/Closed/Locked untuk period lock), **Currency Management** (mata uang ISO 4217, tipe & kurs bertanggal presisi tinggi), dan **Chart of Accounts** (akun bersegmen, kombinasi valid, hierarki, dan **Posting Rule** sebagai jembatan sub-ledger → GL). Fondasi ini menjadi kerangka referensi bagi seluruh transaksi finansial pada BAB 5.

